---
import SectionLabel from '../ui/SectionLabel.astro';
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
---
<section class="wash-ivory relative overflow-hidden pb-20 pt-20 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-28" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="container-site relative max-w-[900px] text-center">
    <SectionLabel class="reveal !text-[0.7rem]">About Norbu Healing</SectionLabel>
    <h2 id="about-title" class="reveal mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[800px] !text-[clamp(1.6rem,2.2vw+1rem,2.4rem)] !leading-[1.25]" style="--d:100ms">
      A multi-service lifestyle and wellness brand built on holistic well-being, professional excellence and quality service
    </h2>
    <p class="reveal mt-8 text-gray-600" style="--d:160ms">Established in Bhutan, Norbu Healing brings together four distinct yet interconnected businesses: Norbu Healing Arts Centre, Norbu Healing Hotel, Norbu Healing Salon and Norbu International Wellness Institute. Together, they offer an integrated experience for relaxation, personal care, hospitality and professional growth.</p>
    <p class="reveal mt-4 text-gray-600" style="--d:200ms">Our approach combines Bhutanese healing wisdom with modern techniques and professional practices. Across every department, we aim to provide thoughtful service, a welcoming environment and experiences shaped around the needs of our clients, guests and trainees.</p>
    <div class="reveal mt-9" style="--d:240ms"><Button href="/about/" variant="outline-dark" arrow>Our Story</Button></div>
  </div>
</section>
